(30,21,'hlj',NULL,'1/100 MG Aile Strike Gundam Ver. RM','<p>An amazingly detailed and fully posable snap-fit Master Grade model of Aile Strike Gundam Ver. RM. Molded in multiple colors, so painting is not entirely necessary. A stand is included as well.</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 19:32:30','2025-12-24 19:32:30'),
