(105,91,'hlj',NULL,'1/144 RG GN-001 Gundam Exia','<p>At last, a Real Grade kit of Gundam Exia! Fully posable after assembly, it comes with the GN Sword, two GN Beam Sabers, two GN Beam Daggers, a GN Short Blade and GN Long Blade. Parts molded in multiple colors, so painting isn&amp;amp;#39;t really necessary (although it&amp;amp;#39;ll look extra amazing with some paint added). Kit includes decals.&amp;amp;nbsp;</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 21:30:29','2025-12-24 21:30:29'),
