(138,116,'hlj',NULL,'1/144 HGUC MSM-04G Juaggu (Unicorn Ver.)','<p>&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;nbsp;The Juaggu has a face only a mother could love - a mother elephant that is. &amp;amp;nbsp;Kind of cute in his own way, the Juaggu comes with those monster finger cannons and is able to do quite a bit of damage. &amp;amp;nbsp;This kit features a fair bit of articulation and even comes with plenty of markings!</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 22:11:50','2025-12-24 22:11:50'),
