(141,118,'hlj',NULL,'1/144 HGUC RX-0 Unicorn Gundam 02 Banshee (Destroy Mode)','<p>&amp;amp;nbsp;&amp;amp;nbsp;At long last the Banshee has arrived. &amp;amp;nbsp;Similar to its predecessor, the Unicorn Gundam (linked below), the Banshee has a psycho frame this time in gold but the headgear is slightly different. &amp;amp;nbsp;He also comes with weapons which mount to his forearms for extra firepower. &amp;amp;nbsp;Also available is the Banshee Unicorn Mode HG kit (linked below).</p>',NULL,'2025-12-24 22:14:56','2025-12-24 22:14:56'),
