(367,232,'hlj',NULL,'CharZaku-Kun 3D Rubber Mascot Keychain','<p>Bandai brings us a fun 3D mascot keychain featuring CharZaku-kun, the character who conveys the fun of Gunpla! A rubber charm with the character&amp;#x27;s name is included. You&amp;#x27;ll love it -- order yours today!</p>',NULL,'2025-12-25 09:39:17','2025-12-25 09:39:17'),
