(451,6,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/premium-bandai-real-grade-rg-1-144-expansion-effect-unit-seraphim-feather-for-rg-wing-gundam-zero-ew?_pos=3&_psq=RG+1%2F144+WING+GUNDAM+ZERO&_ss=e&_v=1.0','Premium Bandai Real Grade (RG) 1/144 Expansion Effect Unit \"Seraphim Feather\" for RG Wing Gundam Zero EW','<p>Expansion effect unit &quot;Seraphim Feather&quot; is released, illustrating the scenes from the story Mobile Suit Gundam W Endless Waltz for RG Wing Gundam Zero EW!　This expansion set reproduce the images of the feather fluttering in air using a display that combines the &#039;Seraphim Feather&#039; effect parts with &quot;RG 1/144 Wing Gunda</p>',NULL,'2026-01-10 03:57:17','2026-01-10 03:57:17'),
(452,581,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/dg-006-blanka-tigro-bann07579','DG-006 Blanka Tigro | HLJ.com','<p>This is an injection-plastic racing car model kit. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Includes the parts you need to build this Geki-Drive racing car! Molded in white, black and purple; includes decals for the markings.</p><p>Car requires two AAA batteries, not included.</p>',NULL,'2026-01-16 04:01:26','2026-01-16 04:01:26'),
(453,5,'bandai','https://global.bandai-hobby.net/en-us/item/01_6764/','MG 1/100 GUNDAM BARBATOS LUPUS','<div class=\"pg-products__instructionTxt\">\r\n                \r\n                              </div>\r\n\r\n                              <div class=\"pg-products__article\">\r\n                  <div><div><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">\"GUNDAM Barbatos Lupus\" is commercialized at the long-awaited MG! The latest \"GUNDAM frame\" allows for even more dynamic poses!</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">■ GUNDAM ・In addition to updating the shoulder joint, the frame has a new range of motion of the lumbar tilt back and forth, enabling even more supple poses.</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">■ The backpack is equipped with a swing gimmick that does not interfere with the range of motion. In addition, the arm can be deployed without replacement.</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">The 200mm gun with arms can be rotated and slid to reproduce the shooting form.</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">■ Comes with joint parts for hanging the twin mace in a backpack.</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">■ Equipped with a movable gimmick that interlocks the back of the knee armor according to the movement of bending the legs. In addition, the leg and heel armor can be moved to avoid interference and perform a variety of actions.</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">■ Pilot figure (Mikazuki Augus) that can be boarded in the cockpit hatch is included.</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[Accessories]</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">■ Sword Mace × 1</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">■ Twin mace × 1 set</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">■ Arm 200mm gun ×2</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">■ Figures × 2 types</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">■ Joint parts × 1 set</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">■ Fingertip parts × 1 set</span></p><p class=\"PlaygroundEditorTheme__paragraph pg-article__img\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">■ Seals × 2 types</span></p></div></div>                </div>','{\"bandai_age_text\": \"over the age of 15\"}','2026-01-16 04:37:47','2026-01-16 04:37:47'),
(454,273,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-144-scale-hg-gundam-gp01fb-banh603920-up','HG Gundam GP01Fb | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, high-grade or better injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             HG version of the GP01Fb. Molded in Bandai\'s patented multi-gate technology that allows multiple colors on one tree. Core fighter is removable. Includes shield and beam rifle. Rocket thrusters are posable.',NULL,'2026-01-22 22:30:09','2026-01-22 22:30:09'),
(455,170,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-zz-gundam-ver-ka-banh631510-up','MG ZZ Gundam Ver. Ka | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Designed by master mecha designer Hajime Katoki, Bandai\'s Master Grade ZZ Gundam Ver. Ka is fully transformable into the G-Fortress! The robot\'s torso forms the Core Block,which transforms into the Core Fighter; it can also combine with the Double Beam Rifle, Core Top (the Gundam\'s upper body) and Core Base (the lower body) to form the full G-Fortress. The forehead contains the powerful Hi-Mega Cannon.  More mechanical detail has been added inside the gaps that open during transformation or posing, the knee joints have been improved with a sliding mechanism, and it also comes with its sizable backpack! In addition to the Double Beam Rifle, it\'s armed with two Beam Sabers and more. You won\'t want to miss out on this historic kit, so order it today!</p><p><br></p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 16:42:55','2026-01-23 16:42:55'),
