(524,166,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/0af7b240-ab87-11e7-eddc-6a709af253d4?_pos=1&_sid=f729fc8c4&_ss=r','MG RX-93-v2 Hi Nu Gundam Ver. Ka 1/100','<p>–  Hi-NU Gundam has a lineup in MG with Ver.Ka. Under the supervision of mechanic designer Hajime Katoki, new proportions have been realized.–  While utilizing the know-how cultivated in MG NU Gundam Ver.Ka, the difference in armor and armament, characteristic funnel, etc. are reproduced.–  LED unit can be installed.– </p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 21:56:16','2026-01-23 21:56:16'),
(525,166,'canada_computers','https://www.canadacomputers.com/en/powered-by-amd/225854/amd-video-card-100-506189-radeon-pro-w6400-4gb-gddr6-100-506189.html?keyword=5061591','AMD Video Card 100-506189 RADEON PRO W6400 4GB GDDR6','<p>AMD Video Card 100-506189 RADEON PRO W6400 4GB GDDR6</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 21:56:19','2026-01-23 21:56:19'),
(526,166,'hobby_bee','https://hobby-bee.com/products/bandai-hobby-mg-1-100-rx-93-%CE%BD2-hi-%CE%BDgundam-ver-ka','Bandai Hobby MG 1/100 RX-93-V2 Hi-Νu Gundam Ver.Ka (5061591)','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit.</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 21:56:20','2026-01-23 21:56:20'),
(527,166,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/master-grade-1-100-rx-93-%CE%BD2-hi-nu-gundam-ver-ka?_pos=3&_sid=ef115145d&_ss=r','Master Grade (MG) 1/100 RX-93-ν2 Hi-Nu Gundam Ver.Ka','<p>The formidable Hi-Nu Gundam gets the &quot;Version Ka&quot; treatment!  Amuro Ray&#039;s customized mount from &quot;Char&#039;s Counterattack&quot; becomes a MasterGrade kit with design overseen by master mecha designer Hajime Katoki. Fully posable after assembly, this glorious Gundam can have LEDs installed (LED units sold separately and not incl</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 21:56:45','2026-01-23 21:56:45'),
(528,166,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-hi-nu-gundam-ver-ka-banh615916-up','MG Hi-Nu Gundam Ver.Ka | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>The formidable Hi-Nu Gundam gets the \"Version Ka\" treatment!  Amuro Ray\'s customized mount from \"Char\'s Counterattack\" becomes a MasterGrade kit with design overseen by master mecha designer Hajime Katoki. Fully posable after assembly, this glorious Gundam can have LEDs installed (LED units sold separately and not included) if you choose. It\'s armed to the teeth with a beam rifle, a hyper bazooka, a shield, six fin funnels, three beam sabers, and a stand.  You won\'t want to miss out on this one! </p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 22:02:43','2026-01-23 22:02:43'),
(529,257,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/mg-wing-gundam-zero-ew-ver-ka-1-100?_pos=1&_sid=e7542a7ce&_ss=r','MG Gundam Wing Zero EW Ver. Ka 1/100','<p>From &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz,&quot; comes the Wing Gundam Zero EW Ver.Ka, fully supervised by Hajime Katoki! It&#039;s been recreated with completely new sculpting. Thorough testing of each joint has resulted in the development of the white wing extension and interlocking gimmick, as well as the Twin Buster Rifle</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 22:20:09','2026-01-23 22:20:09'),
(530,257,'canada_computers','https://www.canadacomputers.com/en/model-building-kits-14/260061/bandai-hobby-mg-1-100-wing-gundam-zero-ew-ver-ka-gundam-w-endless-waltz-model-kit-5060760.html?keyword=5060760','BANDAI Hobby MG 1/100 Wing Gundam Zero (EW) Ver.Ka \'Gundam W: Endless Waltz\' Model kit','<p>BANDAI Hobby MG 1/100 Wing Gundam Zero (EW) Ver.Ka &#039;Gundam W: Endless Waltz&#039; Model kit</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 22:20:11','2026-01-23 22:20:11'),
(531,257,'hobby_bee','https://hobby-bee.com/products/bandai-hobby-mg-1-100-wing-gundam-zero-ew-ver-ka-endless-waltz','Bandai Hobby MG 1/100 Wing Gundam Zero (EW) Ver.Ka ','<p>The Wing Gundam Zero from &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam Wing: Endless Waltz&quot; now gets a new Ver.Ka release, directly supervised by Hajme Katoki! Each joint has been thoroughly inspected, and the development of the white wings, interlocking gimmicks, and twin-buster rifle shooting poses has been pursued. As a new gimmick, the twi</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 22:20:12','2026-01-23 22:20:12'),
(532,257,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/gundam-base-limited-master-grade-mg-1-100-xxxg-00w0-wing-gundam-zero-ew-ver-ka-titanium-finish?_pos=2&_psq=MG+1%2F100+WING+GUNDAM+ZERO+EW+Ver.Ka&_ss=e&_v=1.0','Gundam Base Limited Master Grade (MG) 1/100 XXXG-00W0 Wing Gundam Zero EW Ver.Ka (Titanium Finish)','<p>Bandai Spirits has released the Master Grade Ver. Ka 1/100 Wing Gundam Zero EW in the pretty Titanium Finish treatment, and sold in Gundam Base as a limited release! The kit is featured with titanium finish for its white armor pieces also to emphasize its white wings! In addition to the titanium white parts, the kit is</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 22:20:36','2026-01-23 22:20:36'),
(533,259,'panda_hobby','https://pandahobby.ca/products/mg-narrative-gundam-c-packs-ver-ka-1-100?_pos=1&_sid=99790cfc5&_ss=r','MG Narrative Gundam C-Packs Ver. Ka 1/100','<p>The mobile suit &quot;Narrative Gundam C Equipment&quot; developed as a psycho frame test machine is made into a three-dimensional version of MG Ver.Ka. Equipped with a number of gimmicks created by Hajime Katoki from both the story and plastic model perspectives. The thickness of the clear parts of the Psycho Frame are adjusted</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 23:02:55','2026-01-23 23:02:55'),
(534,259,'canada_computers','https://www.canadacomputers.com/en/model-building-kits-14/275307/bandai-hobby-mg-1-100-fazz-ver-ka-5058880.html?keyword=mg 1100 narrative gundam c-packs ver.ka','BANDAI Hobby MG 1/100 FAZZ Ver.Ka','<p>BANDAI Hobby MG 1/100 FAZZ Ver.Ka</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 23:03:01','2026-01-23 23:03:01'),
(535,259,'hobby_bee','https://hobby-bee.com/products/bandai-hobby-mg-1-100-narrative-gundam-c-packs-ver-ka','Bandai Hobby MG 1/100 Narrative Gundam C-Packs Ver. Ka','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit.</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 23:03:03','2026-01-23 23:03:03'),
(536,259,'argama_hobby','https://argamahobby.com/products/master-grade-mg-1-100-rx-9-c-narrative-gundam-c-packs-ver-ka?_pos=1&_psq=MG+1%2F100+NARRATIVE+GUNDAM+C-PACKS+Ver.Ka&_ss=e&_v=1.0','Master Grade (MG) 1/100 RX-9/C Narrative Gundam C-PACKS Ver.Ka','<p>The Psycho Frame test machine Narrative Gundam C-Packs from &quot;Mobile Suit Gundam Narrative&quot; is the subject of this Master Grade Ver. Ka model kit from Bandai! It&#039;s equipped with a number of gimmicks created by Hajime Katoki. The thickness of the clear parts of the Psycho Frame are adjusted, with details engraved on the</p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 23:03:24','2026-01-23 23:03:24'),
(537,267,'hlj','https://www.hlj.com/1-100-scale-mg-nu-gundam-ver-ka-banh554543-up','MG Nu Gundam Ver.KA | HLJ.com','<p>This is a posable, Master-Grade injection-plastic kit of an item from the Gundam universe. </p>\n            <br>\n             <p>Bandai\'s big Gunpla release of 2012 is old fan favorite Nu Gundam as drawn by famous Gundam artist Hajime Katoki.  The original Master Grade Nu Gundam released way back in 2001 and a lot has changed in Gunpla engineering and the new Nu Gundam Ver Ka is an excellent example of just how far Bandai have come.  Key features of the Nu include an all non-ABS plastic frame making it lighter, hidden green psycho frame that is exposed when certain sections of the armor seperate, the ability to take Bandai\'s LED to light up the head, water-slide decals for markings, and the option to build it as a twin Fin Funnel set up! </p><p><br></p>',NULL,'2026-01-23 23:57:08','2026-01-23 23:57:08'),
(538,597,'plamod','https://plamod.com/retailer/products/5062042',NULL,NULL,'[]','2026-01-24 01:17:29','2026-01-24 01:17:29');
